-Windows workspace: `%LOCALAPPDATA%\ProxyFoundry`. macOS/Linux: `~/.local/share/ProxyFoundry` or `$XDG_DATA_HOME/ProxyFoundry`. Set `PROXY_FOUNDRY_HOME` before launching to choose another location.
